# S14 Part 29 — every Dockerfile in this repo (infrastructure/docker/)
# builds with the repo root as its context; without this file that
# context includes .git history, every workspace's node_modules, build
# output, and any local .env file a developer has sitting around. None
# of that should ever be sent to the Docker daemon or be copyable into
# an image layer, even by an accidental future `COPY . .`.

.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/*.log

# Local-only secrets — every Dockerfile takes its configuration via
# `environment:`/`--build-arg`, never by reading a checked-out .env file.
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Editor/OS cruft, not needed in any build context.
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
